WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.552 --> 00:00:11.640
Wedding-parent makeup takes at least an hour and a half, sometimes up to two hours, because it goes beyond ordinary makeup to include reshaping the facial structure.

2
00:00:11.976 --> 00:00:18.960
Middle-aged wedding parents need structural makeup that rebuilds sagging eyelids, deeper wrinkles, and a softened facial contour.

3
00:00:19.296 --> 00:00:27.072
The skin finish in particular uses a special technique of layering thin coats multiple times rather than applying one thick layer, so it looks natural.

4
00:00:27.408 --> 00:00:36.552
Only this careful method keeps the makeup from breaking down over the five to six hours of the ceremony, and keeps that rich glow coming through as time passes.

5
00:00:36.888 --> 00:00:41.280
It also involves building volume as if filling air between thinning strands of hair,

6
00:00:41.616 --> 00:00:49.152
and seamlessly blending in a hairpiece is a highly skilled process that also demands precision and time.
